                                "sense_id": "d0ede5f6-3b25-301f-a452-600176f0f423",
                                "text": "All grades pass before you, from the pushful American commercial man interested in a patent medicine, to the proud Indian Rajah with his turbaned suite; from the variety actress to the daughter of a peer, or the wife of a millionaire pork-butcher doing Europe."
                            },
                            {
