                                "sense_id": "d0ede5f6-3b25-301f-a452-600176f0f423",
                                "text": "He met Gluck, who a little later was quite inaccessible to the most pushful of young men; also Dittersdorf and Wagenseil, who, whatever we may think of them, were very high and unapproachable musicians in their time."
                            },
